# Builds the portable suite for a real browser.
#
# Deliberately without -lib hxnodejs: that defines `nodejs`, and the whole
# point of this build is the target that has a `window` and none of Node's
# conveniences. ci/js-tests.hxml runs the same cases under Node, which does
# not answer whether they run in a page -- a bundle that loads fine there
# threw "SharedArrayBuffer is not defined" in an ordinary page, while loading,
# before a line of application code ran.
#
# Run it with `node ci/browser/run.js`.
-cp src
-cp tests
-lib utest
-main BrowserTestMain
--js export/browser-tests/tests.js
--macro crossbyte.test.SuiteCoverage.check()
